  <section class="panel access-action-card"><div class="access-step">Option 2</div><h2>Inviter une agence inscrite</h2><p>Choisissez l’agence et le perimetre. Elle devra accepter votre invitation.</p><form method="post" class="access-invite-form"><label>Agence<select name="agency_organization_id" required><option value="">Selectionner</option><?php foreach($agencies as$a):?><option value="<?= (int)$a['id']?>"><?= $e($a['name'])?></option><?php endforeach?></select></label><fieldset><legend>Droits proposes</legend><div class="access-scope-grid"><?php $scopeFields(['projects'=>true,'content'=>true,'validation'=>true,'analytics'=>true,'history'=>true]);?></div></fieldset><button class="button" name="action" value="invite_agency">Envoyer l’invitation</button></form></section>
  <?php elseif($isAgency):?>
  <section class="panel access-action-card access-action-wide"><div class="access-step">Connexion par code</div><h2>Ajouter un client a votre portefeuille</h2><p>Demandez au client son code temporaire. La saisie du code cree seulement une demande : le client garde la validation finale.</p><form method="post" class="access-code-form"><label>Code du client<input name="sync_code" required maxlength="12" autocomplete="off" placeholder="AB12-CD34"></label><fieldset><legend>Droits demandes</legend><div class="access-scope-grid"><?php $scopeFields(['projects'=>true,'content'=>true,'validation'=>true,'analytics'=>true,'history'=>true]);?></div></fieldset><button class="button" name="action" value="connect_with_code">Envoyer la demande</button></form></section>
