    <?php if($g['status']==='Active'):?><details class="access-permission-editor"><summary>Gerer cette connexion <b>⌄</b></summary><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="grant_id" value="<?= (int)$g['id']?>"><?php if($currentIsClient):?><div class="access-scope-grid"><?php $scopeFields($g['scope']);?></div><div class="access-editor-actions"><button class="button" name="action" value="update_permissions">Enregistrer les droits</button><button class="button danger" name="action" value="revoke" onclick="return confirm('Revoquer immediatement cet acces ?')">Revoquer l’acces</button></div><?php else:?><p>Seul le client proprietaire peut etendre les droits. Vous pouvez quitter cette relation a tout moment.</p><button class="button danger" name="action" value="revoke" onclick="return confirm('Quitter cette connexion client ?')">Quitter la connexion</button><?php endif?></form></details><?php endif?>
   </article><?php endforeach?><?php if(!$grants):?><div class="access-empty"><strong>Aucune relation</strong><span>Utilisez un code ou envoyez une invitation pour commencer.</span></div><?php endif?></div>
 </section>
 <section class="panel access-activity"><div class="access-section-head"><div><span class="access-kicker">Audit</span><h2>Journal d’activite</h2><p>Historique des operations sensibles liees aux connexions.</p></div></div><div class="access-timeline"><?php foreach($activity as$log):?><article><i></i><div><strong><?= $e(str_replace(['agency_access.','sync_code.'],['Connexion : ','Code : '],$log['action']))?></strong><span><?= $e($log['actor_name']?:'Systeme')?> · <?= $e(date('d/m/Y H:i',strtotime($log['created_at'])))?></span></div></article><?php endforeach?><?php if(!$activity):?><p class="access-muted">Aucune activite enregistree.</p><?php endif?></div></section>
